006,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.2181818181818182,\"_genreOverlap\":1},{\"id\":314554,\"title\":\"From Overshadowed to Overpowered: Second Reincarnation of a Talentless Sage\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/p4TE3kK2iyuADfDYIRDTxjahdNa.jpg\",\"rating\":7,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.21451612903225808,\"_genreOverlap\":1},{\"id\":31731,\"title\":\"Gunslinger Girl\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/hZrhtwcSydWh3rxQSB6we1KSql7.jpg\",\"rating\":7,\"year\":2003,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.20952380952380953,\"_genreOverlap\":1},{\"id\":130765,\"title\":\"Love All Play\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/m19Cko9WIICOCdV7qiRyj5ZxyhE.jpg\",\"rating\":7,\"year\":2022,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.209375,\"_genreOverlap\":1},{\"id\":31729,\"title\":\"Peach Girl: Super Pop Love Hurricane\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/aUNmqnyILpYRDBGQu9OlNsvrrPS.jpg\",\"rating\":8.3,\"year\":2005,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.209375,\"_genreOverlap\":1},{\"id\":31910,\"title\":\"Naruto Shippūden\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/kV27j3Nz4d5z8u6mN3EJw9RiLg2.jpg\",\"rating\":8.5,\"year\":2007,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.20625000000000002,\"_genreOverlap\":1},{\"id\":31724,\"title\":\"Code Geass: Lelouch of the Rebellion\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/1cFqtyKUbdo1IurdpkK4tDthUJO.jpg\",\"rating\":8.4,\"year\":2006,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.20612244897959184,\"_genreOverlap\":1},{\"id\":31911,\"title\":\"Fullmetal Alchemist: Brotherhood\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/5ZFUEOULaVml7pQuXxhpR2SmVUw.jpg\",\"rating\":8.7,\"year\":2009,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.20468750000000002,\"_genreOverlap\":1}],\"seasonNumber\":1,\"seasonName\":\"Season 1\",\"seasonOverview\":\"\",\"seasonPoster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/78lgjWEb89leZX5FHmlLCblkDKM.jpg\",\"seasonAirDate\":\"2025-01-11\",\"episodes\":[{\"number\":1,\"name\":\"The Vampire of the Public Bathhouse\",\"overview\":\"A vampire works in a bathhouse in hopes of drinking the virgin blood of its heir Rihito, who worryingly falls in love on his first day of high school.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/glXbD9xX0EdidGlVZxJXATazGM5.jpg\",\"rating\":5,\"voteCount\":1,\"airDate\":\"2025-01-11\",\"runtime\":23},{\"number\":2,\"name\":\"The Unpleasant Vampire\",\"overview\":\"Ranmaru worries he has inadvertently made Aoi interested in Rihito. Rihito chats with Aoi the next day after school, but they soon get into trouble.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/7J51cKo7xAmbFzHjajpwIw2dmXO.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2025-01-18\",\"runtime\":23},{\"number\":3,\"name\":\"Franken and the Vampire\",\"overview\":\"After saving Aoi, a hungry Ranmaru tries to resist the urge to feed on her. Rihito soon arrives at the scene and comes to a mistaken realization.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/wyu0F8tck3L7Fw5LAcWa0OunTUh.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2025-01-25\",\"runtime\":23},{\"number\":4,\"name\":\"The Vampire's Slumber Party\",\"overview\":\"Franken proclaims his admiration for Ranmaru, who tasks him with protecting Rihito. Franken tags along with them back to the Tatsuno house for dinner.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/mXmIcUMsmDMkPHaYi00wexyc2IN.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2025-02-01\",\"runtime\":23},{\"number\":5,\"name\":\"The Vampire of Fate\",\"overview\":\"Rihito's teacher Sakamoto — an undercover vampire hunter of notable lineage — learns that his longtime foe Ranmaru lives with the Tatsunos.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/41ScH4Z3H7zWw9vxtgmCznrPpFv.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2025-02-08\",\"runtime\":23},{\"number\":6,\"name\":\"A Vampire Put on the Spot\",\"overview\":\"As Sakamoto tells Ranmaru the reason for his unexpected request, a puzzled Rihito walks in on them. Ranmaru reveals how Sakamoto's ancestor died.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/oyxbjAavg2d1W2oEszldP6ML7yl.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2025-02-15\",\"runtime\":23},{\"number\":7,\"name\":\"The Cornered Vampire\",\"overview\":\"At the Koi Bathhouse, Franken and Sakamoto attempt to bring their plan to fruition by urging Rihito to tell Aoi how he feels about her.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/6nKLNIjNpAYCdvkKmwnsdFZGyGg.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2025-02-22\",\"runtime\":23},{\"number\":8,\"name\":\"A Gal and the Vampire\",\"overview\":\"Tough girl Kaoru is charmed by Rihito's cuteness, but when she goes to return a handkerchief he lent her, she can't seem to drop her brash attitude.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/cleLVwoQsBjpzwdwg2KQZWkheKT.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2025-03-01\",\"runtime\":23},{\"number\":9,\"name\":\"A Certain Family and the Vampire\",\"overview\":\"After a confrontation with Kaoru's father, Ranmaru attempts to drink Kaoru's blood. However, he's repulsed by her makeup — which gives him an idea.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/iW5F8yccDN8R0iHSvT5n2K0Nmvt.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2025-03-08\",\"runtime\":23},{\"number\":10,\"name\":\"Mr. Sakamoto and the Vampire\",\"overview\":\"Sakamoto tells Ranmaru he was attacked by a vampire at the school. After a remedial night class, Franken and Kaoru encounter a boyish-looking vampire.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/rQptDxwkwJ5knmKZ2iYVK8nppq.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2025-03-15\",\"runtime\":23},{\"number\":11,\"name\":\"Love, the Cross, and the Vampire\",\"overview\":\"Thoughts of Rihito give Ranmaru strength as he struggles against the formidable Nagayoshi. Suddenly, Kaoru appears with an improvised weapon in hand.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/4JX48APPwlU5BweW5kdwefMjMLg.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2025-03-22\",\"runtime\":23},{\"number\":12,\"name\":\"And Thus, a New Vampire\",\"overview\":\"Ranmaru asks Rihito's father to let Nagayoshi stay in the apartment behind the bathhouse. A newly inspired Nagayoshi declares he's in love with Kaoru.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/zW2o9KZZd8ipRnfFyqqzGPu0h73.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2025-03-29\",\"runtime\":23}],\"firstAirDate\":\"2025-01-11\"}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}